{"title": "Regional Ring Road projects face delays and changes in plans", "summary": "The Regional Ring Road project, which includes several ring roads across India, has faced fresh delays due to extensions of bid deadlines. The National Highway Authority of India (NHAI) has extended the bid deadline for the sixth time. The Union government has shared key updates on the Vizhinjam-Navaikulam Outer Ring Road plan. The projects are expected to be completed by November 2026 and 2027, respectively.", "summary_points": ["The National Highway Authority of India (NHAI) has extended the bid deadline for the Regional Ring Road project for the sixth time.", "The Union government has shared key updates on the Vizhinjam-Navaikulam Outer Ring Road plan.", "The projects are expected to be completed by November 2026 and 2027, respectively.", "The Regional Ring Road project includes several ring roads across India, including the Pune elevated ring road and the Bengaluru Satellite Town Ring Road.", "Environmental clearance for the Vizhinjam to Navaikulam Outer Ring Road project has been delayed."], "title_hi": "", "summary_hi": "", "summary_points_hi": ["", "", "", "", ""], "framing": {"center": ["Outlets have reported that environmental clearance for the Vizhinjam to Navaikulam Outer Ring Road project has been delayed.", "The Regional Ring Road project includes several ring roads across India, including the Pune elevated ring road and the Bengaluru Satellite Town Ring Road."]}, "framing_hi": {}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "", "sources": [{"source": "Swarajya", "owner": "Swarajya", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE1mY1h1dmRDR1g3UUNWS25XZ1lWM3BSNWtoXzkySG43TEVBd0Vka3dlaXRKdWs2NHFwRVlsVnRGTGtMbkU4NjRJWjBvUkN4UERYczlSS2ZWaHFqdXA5Ymx4UExHcmdJNWJrdzhB?oc=5", "headline": "Pune elevated ring road"}, {"source": "Telangana Today", "owner": "Telangana Today", "lean": "center", "language